ARIA AI — Complete Project Deep-Dive
1. What Is This Project?
Aria AI is a Cognizant Portfolio Advisory & Rebalancing Solution — an AI-powered investment advisor that talks to users through a live voice avatar. It's a full-stack application that:
1. Authenticates users (email/password)
2. Conducts a 13-question voice interview to build a financial profile
3. Deterministically computes an investment allocation (Equities / Debt / Commodities)
4. Checks feasibility (can the user's monthly investment fund their goals?)
5. Presents a live avatar (Azure's "Lisa") speaking the recommendations
6. Saves the portfolio and shows it on a dashboard with rebalancing tools
